# ---- 문지기(무명 — 진행기가 통행을 판정 · 말은 장면 GC_GATE)
npc N-GC-G1 46 21 W look=M1-S4-HR02-H6-T04-2-PF04-HD06-EY00 cond="GC_HOT == 0 and GC_BOSS != 2 and (GAME_HOUR >= 6 and GAME_HOUR < 23) and dead(\"N-GC-G1\") == 0" bark="분양 받으러 왔어? 상담료 50."
npc N-GC-G2 21 35 S look=M2-S4-HR01-H4-T04-2-PF00-HD08-EY00 cond="GC_HOT == 0 and GC_BOSS != 2 and (GAME_HOUR >= 6 and GAME_HOUR < 23) and dead(\"N-GC-G2\") == 0" bark="분양 끝. 상담은 동쪽 초소."
